{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<strong> Supermarket Guard Simulator</strong>\u00a0you play as a security guard whose job is to prevent shoplifting and drive company profits to keep shareholders happy, regardless of the cost. Setup security systems, catch thieves, take on orders from management. The game encourages world exploration and has a story element.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secret Service</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You don't want to disturb customers with your presence, it will make them more likely to leave a bad review. Keep it cool and respect personal space of others, but still keep an eye on them. Some heroes stay in the shadows just waiting for bad things to happen. Patience is very rewarding sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/be698c8e8681408f9103d846ec6a2d36.poster.avif?t=1763284215\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/be698c8e8681408f9103d846ec6a2d36.webm?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/be698c8e8681408f9103d846ec6a2d36.mp4?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Thieves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you spot a thief do whatever it takes to stop them. React quick as they are very fast, sometimes aggressive and dangerous. Remember, company profits are the number one priority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.poster.avif?t=1763284215\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.webm?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/ff4c63d2a4803ffafbbc39802d53bb2d.mp4?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Setup Robust Security</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use newest (sometimes not so newest) devices and technologies to setup systems that help you catch thieves on the spot. Get different security defense items to help you with that as well.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.poster.avif?t=1763284215\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.webm?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/7e98e3f8f909003ad85c03a1385b1368.mp4?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This business is very territorial and competitive. Protect the store reputation at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.poster.avif?t=1763284215\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.webm?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/cafc59d7ec49b11836f3b617411e3170.mp4?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enforce Store Policies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ensure no store policy is violated. This is good for the business and keeps customers happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.poster.avif?t=1763284215\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.webm?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/extras/842a32fe2dab60ee0d376ed580e6a9af.mp4?t=1763284215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring Shareholder Value</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do everything a real security guard does to bring massive value to the Shareholders. Do your best and grind that promotion or find a way to escape capitalism?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720580?t=1763284215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720580?t=1763284215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/fa4caedad4c51c35b5ca5c59fcf15904269a1110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763284215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720580/fa4caedad4c51c35b5ca5c59fcf15904269a1110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763284215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":6